    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988960/extras/4bae6eaca74d2249fe34f2c4fa4a5f69.avif?t=1671677053\" /></div><br>If you are considering purchasing a game that is a work in progress, be aware that it may have bugs or unfinished features and that the frequency of updates may change. Your purchase supports the development of the game and helps shape its future. Research the game and developer before making a purchase and be aware of any terms and conditions and refund policies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988960/extras/ab50b4e3967152376b6606ffff36486d.avif?t=1671677053\" /></div><br>In Game Of The Dead, a terrifying twin-stick auto-shooter, you must fight for your life against relentless hordes of zombies. With rich, minimalistic gameplay and a unique deck-building roguelike system, you'll need to power up your character and collect zombie souls to craft and build powerful weapons and abilities. As you progress, you'll also be able to build and upgrade your base to protect yourself from the never-ending waves of undead. Can you survive the night and escape the zombies in Nathan Prince's GAME OF THE DEAD? Play now and find out!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988960/extras/4bae6eaca74d2249fe34f2c4fa4a5f69.avif?t=1671677053\" /></div><br>If you are considering purchasing a game that is a work in progress, be aware that it may have bugs or unfinished features and that the frequency of updates may change. Your purchase supports the development of the game and helps shape its future. Research the game and developer before making a purchase and be aware of any terms and conditions and refund policies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988960/extras/ab50b4e3967152376b6606ffff36486d.avif?t=1671677053\" /></div><br>In Game Of The Dead, a terrifying twin-stick auto-shooter, you must fight for your life against relentless hordes of zombies. With rich, minimalistic gameplay and a unique deck-building roguelike system, you'll need to power up your character and collect zombie souls to craft and build powerful weapons and abilities. As you progress, you'll also be able to build and upgrade your base to protect yourself from the never-ending waves of undead. Can you survive the night and escape the zombies in Nathan Prince's GAME OF THE DEAD? Play now and find out!",
    "short_description": "In Game Of The Dead, a post-apocalyptic twin-stick auto-battler, fight to survive against waves of zombies. Use your skills and strategy to collect cards, build your base, and defeat the undead. Can you outlast the night and emerge victorious? Play now and find out!",
